values ('ap_precalculus', 2, '2.8', array['2.8']::text[], 'convention', 'Contextual restrictions on inverses', 'Besides restricting a function''s domain to make it invertible, contextual restrictions may also limit the applicability of an inverse function.', '[]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'published', 'generated-checked; extractor=anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5; batch=ap-precalculus-reference-u1-u3-2026-10-10; candidate=ap_precalculus-u2-r2-010; ced=2.8.B.5 "contextual restrictions may also limit the applicability of an inverse function"')
